  "id": "limited-capacity-system",
  "term": "limited-capacity system",
  "definition": "A limited-capacity system is a mental system, such as working memory, that has only a restricted amount of processing resources available at one time. When those resources are occupied by one activity, less capacity remains for other experiences or tasks.",
